# A LOGICAL TRIPLE ON A HEADER NODE. Stage 0 consumes an owl:Annotation node's
# triples by subject, as it does an owl:Axiom node's. This node also carries
# rdfs:subClassOf, which is no annotation: swallowing it with the rest shrank
# the input with no omission and no fault, so the verdict read COHERENT over a
# document HOWL had not fully read. It must reach the decoder instead, where a
# blank node that is neither a class expression nor an individual is an
# omission. (Codex review of M1 slice 3.)
# Expect: INCONCLUSIVE, omitted >= 1, exit 2 — never COHERENT.

@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology ; rdfs:label "Mixed header node" .
:C a owl:Class .
[ a owl:Annotation ;
  owl:annotatedSource <http://example.org/t> ;
  owl:annotatedProperty rdfs:label ;
  owl:annotatedTarget "Mixed header node" ;
  rdfs:subClassOf :C ] .
